codex
Implemented the Track B corridor-tree separator family from Section 3.4 and Lemma 8 of the [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.00704).

Local results:

- All G1–G9(c) gates pass.
- Random guessing: 0/200,000; exact density \(6.00\times10^{-7}\).
- Four attacks: 0/8 successes each.
- Reference algorithm: 8/8, averaging 833,716 vertex visits and 3.64 seconds.
- Answer: 39 characters, 2 atoms.
